{
  "id": "doc_fm8vrc36wni",
  "app": "MindNPC",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "设计模式",
  "layout": "both",
  "root": {
    "id": "nv837zlmwni",
    "text": "设计模式",
    "note": "",
    "collapsed": false,
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "nvq1cwt7e98",
        "text": "Outbox Pattern",
        "note": "",
        "collapsed": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "ne2dn0etyrg",
            "text": "要解决的问题",
            "note": "",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "nogyw3o9b4f",
                "text": "双写不一致问题",
                "note": "<p>先写库后发消息，发消息失败则下游丢失事件；先发消息后写库，事务回滚则下游收到脏事件。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "nrbzme099dz",
                "text": "分布式事务的缺点",
                "note": "<p>分布式事务（2PC/XA）代价高、可用性差，Outbox 用本地事务 + 最终一致性替代。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "id": "nlrfr7l70g8",
                "text": "典型场景",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>订单创建后通知库存/积分/风控；</li><li>微服务间领域事件发布；</li><li>CDC 数据同步。</li></ul><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ng46pe9qyrg",
            "text": "核心设计",
            "note": "",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "nyulkzaigml",
                "text": "三要素",
                "note": "<p>三要素：</p><p></p><ol><li>业务表 + outbox 表位于同一数据库，同一本地事务写入</li><li>outbox 记录含 id、aggregate_type、aggregate_id、event_type、payload、status、created_at、retry_count；</li><li>中继（relay/poller）读取未发送记录并投递，成功后标记 SENT 或删除。</li></ol><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "nw1nazwtite",
                "text": "关键约束",
                "note": "<p>关键约束：outbox 表只追加，不参与业务查询；事件需带全局唯一 event_id 供消费端去重。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "n67b8ynqyrg",
            "text": "表结构示例",
            "note": "<pre class=\"code-block\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-lang=\"sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\">CREATE TABLE outbox (\n  id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n  event_id     UUID NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n  aggregate_type VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,\n  aggregate_id   VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,\n  event_type     VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,\n  payload        JSONB NOT NULL,\n  status         SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, -- 0待发 1已发 2失败\n  retry_count    INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),\n  sent_at        TIMESTAMPTZ\n);\nCREATE INDEX idx_outbox_pending ON outbox(status, id);\n</code></pre>\n",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "neb25a0eyrg",
            "text": "写入侧实现",
            "note": "",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "neoreqnmffx",
                "text": "业务操作与 outbox 插入放在同一事务",
                "note": "<pre data-lang=\"java\" class=\"code-block language-java\" spellcheck=\"false\"><code class=\"language-java\">@Transactional\npublic void placeOrder(Order o) {\n  orderRepo.save(o);\n  outboxRepo.save(OutboxEvent.of(\"Order\", o.getId(), \"OrderCreated\", toJson(o)));\n}\n</code></pre><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "n4nxfrpmopb",
                "text": "要点",
                "note": "<p>事件构造在事务内完成；禁止在事务提交前调用 MQ；事务回滚时 outbox 记录一并回滚。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "n0sqeud4yrg",
            "text": "投递侧实现",
            "note": "",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "nsy4r4pip9y",
                "text": "两种中继方式",
                "note": "",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "n6wacnjw4cx",
                    "text": "轮询发布（Polling Publisher）",
                    "note": "<p>定时任务按 id 顺序批量拉取 status=0 的记录，逐条发送后更新状态；实现简单，有延迟与空轮询开销。</p>",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [],
                    "summaries": [],
                    "boundaries": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "nfzkvkwpf6h",
                    "text": "事务日志抓取（CDC，如 Debezium 读 binlog/WAL）",
                    "note": "<p>实时性高、对业务零侵入，需运维 Kafka Connect 等组件。</p>",
                    "collapsed": false,
                    "children": [],
                    "summaries": [],
                    "boundaries": []
                  }
                ],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "nvjbz9fb3mt",
                "text": "投递语义",
                "note": "<p>投递语义为至少一次，失败重试 + 指数退避，超过阈值转死信并告警。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "nmd5qtxpyrg",
            "text": "一致性与幂等",
            "note": "<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>顺序性：</p>\n",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "nq9k9b3g08e",
                "text": "一致性",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>本地事务保证“业务变更 ⇔ 事件入库”原子；</li><li>中继保证最终投递。</li></ul><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "novq28p220u",
                "text": "消费端幂等",
                "note": "<p>重复投递不可避免（发送成功但标记状态失败、CDC 重放），消费端必须幂等：以 event_id 建唯一索引、去重表或状态机判重。</p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "n2f0ipz66l9",
                "text": "顺序性",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>按 aggregate_id 分区投递可保证单聚合内有序；</li><li>轮询需按 id 升序且单线程处理同一聚合。</li></ul><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "nvvmsfynyrg",
            "text": "运维与清理",
            "note": "<p>outbox 表持续增长，需归档/清理策略：已发送记录定期删除或迁移到历史表（按 created_at 分区）。</p>\n<p>监控指标：待发送积压量、最老未发送记录延迟、重试次数、死信数量。</p>\n<p>多实例部署时用 SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED 或分布式锁避免重复抢占。</p>\n",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "nhdamp23yrh",
            "text": "优缺点与替代",
            "note": "",
            "collapsed": false,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "nk3pzx6t2i7",
                "text": "优点",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>实现简单</li><li>不引入分布式事务</li><li>与业务同库天然一致</li><li>可审计可重放。</li></ul><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "n2yqz3zu6hu",
                "text": "缺点",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>存在投递延迟</li><li>增加一次写库</li><li>需维护中继与清理</li><li>CDC 方案运维复杂。</li></ul><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              },
              {
                "id": "nkyyv9dv7yd",
                "text": "横向对比",
                "note": "<p></p><ul><li>事务消息（RocketMQ 半消息）依赖特定 MQ；</li><li>Listen-to-Yourself 适合单库；</li><li>Saga 处理跨服务补偿。</li></ul><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Outbox 常与 Saga、事件驱动架构配合使用。</span><p></p>",
                "collapsed": false,
                "children": [],
                "summaries": [],
                "boundaries": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "createdAt": 1794280347342,
  "updatedAt": 1794282385042
}
